800 characters) and reformatted (wiki markup removed; area, address, hours and price joined on
one line) by pools.py.

Attribution: every listing records the page it came from ("page") and the page revision
("revid"). data/pages.json lists every page read and its revision. The history and authors of a
revision are at https://en.wikivoyage.org/w/index.php?oldid=<revid> and the page's history.

The queries, translations, judge grades, hand grades and every other file in this folder are
under CC BY 4.0 with the rest of the repository's text and data.
